stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Visitor: first session
  Visitor --> Prospect: browses / adds to cart
  Prospect --> NewCustomer: first purchase
  Visitor --> [*]: never returns
  NewCustomer --> Active: repeat purchase
  Active --> Champion: high R, F, M scores
  Champion --> Active: frequency drops
  Active --> AtRisk: no order > 90 days\n(churn probability ≥ 0.7)
  Champion --> AtRisk: engagement decays
  AtRisk --> Active: win-back campaign succeeds
  AtRisk --> Churned: no order in label window
  Churned --> Active: reactivated
  Churned --> [*]
